# This repo's real env files are scoped, not a single root .env:
#
#   backend/.env                                 <- copy from backend/app/config/environments/local.env.example
#   backend/app/config/credentials/shoonya.env    <- copy from backend/app/config/credentials/shoonya.env.example
#
# Both are gitignored. See docs/architecture for why credentials are kept separate
# from general app config.
